<tr id="mwBdg">
<td id="mwBdk">Outstanding Structure Award from <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/International_Association_for_Bridge_and_Structural_Engineering" title="International Association for Bridge and Structural Engineering" id="mwBdo">International Association for Bridge and Structural Engineering</a>.</td></tr>
<tr id="mwBds">
