<tr id="mwBe4">
<td id="mwBe8">International Architecture Award from <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Good_Design_Award_(Chicago)" title="Good Design Award (Chicago)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwBfA">Chicago Athenaeum</a>.</td></tr>
<tr id="mwBfE">
<td id="mwBfI">American Architecture Award from Chicago Athenaeum.</td></tr>
