<tr id="mwBfg">
<td id="mwBfk">Skyscraper Award: Silver Medal from <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Emporis" title="Emporis" id="mwBfo">Emporis</a>.</td></tr>
<tr id="mwBfs">
<td id="mwBfw">Award for Commercial or Retail Structure from <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Institution_of_Structural_Engineers" title="Institution of Structural Engineers" id="mwBf0">Institution of Structural Engineers</a>.</td></tr>
